Encrypting Data
-------------------------------------------
    - To protect data on storage devices
        -SSDs,HHDs, USB drive,cloud storage

    - Via Full-disk and volume encryption
        -Bitlocker,FileVault

    - Via File Encryption
        eg: EFS
    
    Database Encryption
        - Ment to protect stored data in database

        - Could use Transparent Encryption
            - Encrypt all database information with a symmetric key
        
        - Could use Record-level encryption
            - Encrypt individual columns
            - Use separate symmetric keys for each columns
        
    Transport Encryption
        - Protect data traversing the network
        - encrypting in the application
            -Http is used in browsers

        VPN - Virutal private Network
            - Encrypts all data tramsitteed over the network
            - client-based VPN using SSL/ TLS
            - Site to site VPN using IPsec
    

    Encryption algorithms
        - Many ways to encrypt algorithms

          DES. AES

    Key Lengths
        - Make keys long to prevent brute force
        - A weak key is a weak key tho, include variety.
    
