Encryption Technologies
-----------------------------------

    TPM - Trusted Platform Module -
        - hardware ment to give cryptographic capabilities to a 
        computer
        -Securely stores and manages key capabilities

    HSM - hardware Security Module
        - Used in large environments
        - clusters, ment to store thousands of cryptographic keys
        - Key backup on the hardware

    Key Management System
        - Used due to multitude of services (Cloud, on premise, ect)
        - Helps to manage all keys from a centralized manager
        - Often provided as 3rd party software
        - All management from one console(creating keys for ssh,TLS/SSl)
            - associating keys with specific users
            - Rotating keys on regular intervals
            - Log key use and important events
    
